# The zstd container is a shipping artifact, not a repo artifact. Measured: as a
# git object the raw web costs 2.97 MB against the container's 2.81 MB — 155 KB
# apart — while the container costs ~37 ms of pure-Rust zstd on first touch
# against the raw web's ~4 ms. For a file read at startup out of the repo, that
# trade goes the other way. assets/animals.web IS committed; see
# docs/ASSET_ARCHIVE.md.
assets/animals.web.zst
